    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεράν-ιον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρᾰνος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Geranium tuberosum</i>, a plant, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.116
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕτερον γ.</span>
			<i>crane's-bill, Erodium malacoides</i>, ibid.; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεράνιος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γεράνιος</span> a
				<i>plaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.15
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> substance
			used in Alchemy, Pelag.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.256
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
